AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000055> "Pain that is experienced in an area where a limb no longer exists.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000055> <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9625-1899>)
