# Class: <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000064> (freezing sensation quality)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000064> "A sensation quality that characterizes a sensation as being intensely cold, typically accompanied by qualities of stillness, heaviness, numbness, and in extreme cases a paradoxical burning or painful character.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000064> <http://orcid.org/0000-0001-9625-1899>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000064> "2025-05-12T17:06:51Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000064> "freezing sensation quality"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000064> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000042>)

