# Class: <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000068> (intense sensation quality)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/intense") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000068> "A great or extreme sensation quality.")
