SubClassOf(<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000069> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000042>)

# Class: <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000070> (stabbing sensation quality)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000070> "An intense, sudden, and sharp sensation, often described as a knife-like or shooting, sensation quality that pierces a specific area.")
