AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/PAIN/0000071> "Pain experienced as an intense, sudden, and sharp sensation, often described as a knife-like or shooting pain that pierces a specific body area.")
