# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0000040> (throbbing pain)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0000040> "Pain that is experienced as a rhythmic, pulsating, or beating sensation in which the pain's intensity waxes and wanes in periodic bursts. Throbbing pain is typically synchronized with the cardiac cycle.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PAIN_0000040> <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9625-1899>)
